flowchart LR
    U[User Dashboard] --> FE[Frontend: public/index.html + script.js]
    FE --> API[Express API: /api/extract]
    API --> JOB[Job Manager + In-Memory Status]
    JOB --> WF[Workflow.js]

    WF --> Q[Request Queue]
    WF --> MODE{Mode}
    MODE -->|Fast| CH[Crawlee Cheerio Crawler]
    MODE -->|Deep| PU[Puppeteer Fetcher]

    CH --> CL[Cleaner.js\nReadability + Fallback DOM Cleanup]
    PU --> CL

    CL --> EX{Extraction Strategy}
    EX -->|AI| LLM[SinglePromptExtractor.js\nGroq LLM + Bottleneck + Retry]
    EX -->|Deterministic| DET[Rule/Schema Extraction]

    LLM --> RES[Normalized Result]
    DET --> RES

    RES --> DB[(SQLite\nJobs + Results\nWAL Mode)]
    RES --> SSE[SSE Event Stream]
    DB --> EXP[CSV/JSON Export]
    SSE --> FE
    EXP --> FE

    API --> CANCEL[Cancellation Set]
    CANCEL --> WF

    subgraph Reliability Controls
      CAP[maxRequestsPerCrawl]
      DEP[Depth Limit + Same-Domain Link Filter]
      TRUNC[Text Truncation Before LLM]
      ABORT[Abort Heavy Resources]
    end

    CAP --> WF
    DEP --> WF
    TRUNC --> LLM
    ABORT --> PU
